  THE 2-HOUR SET NOW BOUNDS ABOVE TWO HOURS, and the honest reading is that
  its NAME is the rental and its second figure is not a promise. bn_g16 went
  from 36 to 46 priced minutes on 2026-09-10 when a third subject tile was
  added to its swept set, and 46 KERNEL minutes bound to 109. The set is
  unchanged because what it selects is unchanged: both payload arms and
  their preconditions, nothing else. The bound is the ILLUSTRATION
