  NEITHER SET CONTAINS THE NOISE FLOOR, and that is the decision this block
  exists to record rather than to hide. It is 120 WALL minutes on its own,
  it sits above both payload arms in the read order, and a rental that ENTERS
  it without finishing it is killed inside it -- which fails that script's own
  V2, the planned replicates ran, so even the partial floor is unquotable and
  the minutes buy nothing at all. The floor wants a booking of its own, and
  until it has one the sigma in the line below stays ASSUMED and every effect
  in this study is read against a prior rather than against a measurement.
  
  AND THE ALIAS ARM IS NOT WHAT PUT THEM OUT OF REACH. It is 14 WALL minutes
  and it runs ABOVE the floor, so it moved every arm below the floor down by
  exactly those minutes and moved nothing above it at all. bn_g16 was already
  past a two-hour booking before this arm existed, and the thing that put it
  there was the floor. The fix is the --only line, not a shorter arm.
  
